{"unit_id":"Wlaeg__dsh-notify-linux#card-zh","repo":"Wlaeg/dsh-notify-linux","commit":"4746312db050600faeb4fb91b02dd9c48f02244a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-linux（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在 DSH 任务完成、等待选择、等待批准或执行出错时提醒用户。它在 Host 侧监听四类事件，通过 Linux 桌面通知工具发送通知并播放提示音，同时提供 Web 设置页、页内浮层和系统通道不可用时的浏览器通知与合成音兜底。设置可按事件启停，可控制子代理通知、窗口聚焦时抑制提醒和冷却时间，也可试听通知。适合希望离开 DSH 页面后仍能收到任务进度提醒的 Linux 用户。需有 notify-send 与 paplay 或 canberra-gtk-play；系统命令不可用时可由浏览器通知补充。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:289-343","index.js:187-207","client.js:598-677"]}
{"unit_id":"Wlaeg__dsh-notify-linux#card-en","repo":"Wlaeg/dsh-notify-linux","commit":"4746312db050600faeb4fb91b02dd9c48f02244a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-notify-linux alerts DSH Web users when turns finish, choices or approvals are needed, or errors occur. It sends Linux desktop notifications and chimes. Its settings page controls event switches and cooldown, while browser notices can provide a fallback. Useful when away from the DSH page.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:289-343","index.js:187-207","client.js:598-677"]}
