{"unit_id":"Wlaeg__dsh-notify-linux#feature-1","repo":"Wlaeg/dsh-notify-linux","commit":"4746312db050600faeb4fb91b02dd9c48f02244a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-linux 的功能「任务事件提醒」：在整轮结束、需要用户回答、等待工具批准或发生错误时发送对应桌面通知和提示音。事件触发后由 Host 侧处理，并可分别关闭事件类型。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:289-343"]}
{"unit_id":"Wlaeg__dsh-notify-linux#feature-2","repo":"Wlaeg/dsh-notify-linux","commit":"4746312db050600faeb4fb91b02dd9c48f02244a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-linux 的功能「Linux 桌面通知与声音」：通过 notify-send 弹出通知，并优先用 paplay 播放系统声音文件，缺少声音文件时尝试 canberra-gtk-play。事件发生时自动触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:187-207"]}
{"unit_id":"Wlaeg__dsh-notify-linux#feature-3","repo":"Wlaeg/dsh-notify-linux","commit":"4746312db050600faeb4fb91b02dd9c48f02244a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-linux 的功能「浏览器设置和兜底」：在 DSH 设置页配置提醒开关、音效、冷却和聚焦选项，并显示页内提示；系统通知不可用时可使用浏览器通知，声音兜底需启用浏览器合成音。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:598-677","index.js:63-76"]}
{"unit_id":"Wlaeg__dsh-notify-linux#feature-4","repo":"Wlaeg/dsh-notify-linux","commit":"4746312db050600faeb4fb91b02dd9c48f02244a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-linux 的功能「持久化提醒偏好」：配置保存到 DSH profile 下的 JSON 文件，设置页提交配置后立即生效；缺失或无效配置会退回默认值。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:87-128","index.js:450-455"]}
{"unit_id":"Wlaeg__dsh-notify-linux#feature-5","repo":"Wlaeg/dsh-notify-linux","commit":"4746312db050600faeb4fb91b02dd9c48f02244a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-linux 的功能「测试提醒」：设置页的试用操作向插件 API 发送事件类型，并经真实通知路径触发一次提示，便于确认当前投递能力。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:458-469","client.js:671-677"]}
{"unit_id":"Wlaeg__dsh-notify-linux#caveat-1","repo":"Wlaeg/dsh-notify-linux","commit":"4746312db050600faeb4fb91b02dd9c48f02244a","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-linux 使用前须知：系统桌面通知和提示音依赖本机 Linux 命令及声音主题文件；命令不可用时浏览器通知可兜底，合成声音需单独启用。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:199-207","client.js:608-615"]}
